cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Tehran Stock Exchange Corporate Financial Distress Prediction Dataset (1392–1402): Analysis-Ready Company-Year Panel and Reproducibility Materials"
abstract: >-
  An analysis-ready company-year panel of Iranian listed non-financial
  companies for one-year-ahead corporate financial distress prediction,
  covering Jalali fiscal years 1392–1402, together with the contracts,
  dictionaries, quality-control records and audit surfaces needed to reproduce
  and check its construction. The primary modeling surface contains 1,012
  company-year pairs across 119 companies and 115 columns, with 80 positive and
  932 negative outcomes. Predictor admission uses a prespecified fixed
  four-Jalali-month regulatory availability lag, which is an assumption about
  availability rather than an observed publication timestamp.
